# What a closure that never dies has captured never dies. That the closure is written does not say that it is made.
# always() makes Cat on every way to its return: the helper and its table are held for good in any build, so the helper lies in a word, and Cat and use capture nothing.
# maybe() makes Dog in one arm. Where the arm is not taken nothing but use holds the helper, and it is let go with use: it stays a capture of both.
